legend bottom
  delivery.sql.accept(): same message ID + body is a no-op; changed body raises MessageConflict.
  stage(): caller commits owned state + outbox. consume_result / handle_command commit inbox + state.
  publish_due(): commit row claim before SQS send; retry later. Shared code, separate local rows.
  Technical support, not business aggregate members; message_id PK, no root FK. Selected fields.
